  "details": "Allow world creators to access the user's status (blue green orange red) for in world actions\n\nSince there was recent talks about access to events related to friends invites and vrc+ status via udon, i thought this may be a really good addition that goes alongside this.\n\nFor game worlds for example, users could be rewarded of being joinable by an xp boost, in social hubs have extra things / rooms if the user is in an open instance + green / blue, promoting accessible social statuses and sharing activities with others",
